  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b2bec28576622e5469ff125d61c4e3a5, type: 3}
  m_Name: BH_4_OnDownloadOfChats
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - speakerName: PIP
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3e4ff024cd09fad41a6f1af4bf8b77be, type: 3}
    text: Wow... I feel offended.
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ad771f752afefa244b5c465f7173d61b, type: 3}
    text: You feel offended? I FEEL OFFENDED!
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: Now i'm <i>pissed</i>. Let's do some crimes >B ) \nI need you to steal
      something and hack some devices for me.
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: 'The Boss is obsessed with his <i>super-extra-limited collection</i> of
      Kenney action figuers. There are some around the house that worths a fortune. '
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5ff570c2964bbe748bf7be2ffcc8bd95, type: 3}
    text: Also, steal their coffee machine in the kitchen, the pot on the table in
      the living room, and hack the son's pc. Just for fun...
    tags: 
  - speakerName: PIP
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3e4ff024cd09fad41a6f1af4bf8b77be, type: 3}
    text: ...ok? Sure, why not. I don't care anymore.
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ad771f752afefa244b5c465f7173d61b, type: 3}
    text: I will help you as always by hacking the devices around.
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ad771f752afefa244b5c465f7173d61b, type: 3}
    text: We'll be thieves of the Internet of Things. Let's be <i><b>IoThieves!!!</b></i>
    tags: 
